---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Photography Through Time.">
  <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">About this site</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Photography Through Time is a knowledge base for photographers: how photography came to be, from the camera obscura to computational photography, and how it works. The <a href={url('/')}>timeline</a> shows every entry and how they connect; each entry has its own page with the story, the physics, the makers and the sources.</p>
    <p>It was inspired by <i>Politics Through Time</i>, a star-chart timeline of political ideas. The code here is original.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
